        "title": "Some people claim that not enough of the waste from homes is recycled. They say that the only way to increase recycling is for governments to make it a legal requirement. To what extent do you think laws are needed to make people recycle more of their...",
        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-DSCXdXxr0oDVv3xRiQTlhNIIgff\"><em><strong>Some people claim that not enough of the waste from homes is recycled. They say that the only way to increase recycling is for governments to make it a legal requirement. To what extent do you think l</strong><strong>aw</strong><strong>s are needed to make people recycle more of their waste?</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 2 - Recycling Laws Debate&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/essay-structure-logical-framework\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theo Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></a></strong></span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> Hiểu đề &amp; viết Introduction:</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L4QBdnvMooiV1cxe36IlLwVSgqe\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Đề Recycling Laws Debate&nbsp;cho 1 quan điểm:</strong> Một số người cho rằng kh&ocirc;ng đủ lượng r&aacute;c thải từ c&aacute;c hộ gia đ&igrave;nh được t&aacute;i chế. Họ n&oacute;i rằng c&aacute;ch duy nhất để tăng cường t&aacute;i chế l&agrave; ch&iacute;nh phủ phải biến điều n&agrave;y th&agrave;nh một y&ecirc;u cầu ph&aacute;p l&yacute;.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NhkkdbybxoxACGxEfTilnwbUg8e\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u hỏi:</strong> Bạn nghĩ rằng luật ph&aacute;p cần thiết đến mức n&agrave;o để khiến mọi người t&aacute;i chế nhiều r&aacute;c thải hơn?</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CaGhdYOr4odHmMxWQ9flznKwgcd\">Dựa v&agrave;o đề b&agrave;i Recycling Laws Debate&nbsp;v&agrave; c&acirc;u hỏi, ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; thể viết được phần Introduction. Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, phần Introduction lu&ocirc;n c&oacute; 2 c&acirc;u:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VgEDdn50bo6hL6xwMg7lgcFmgmf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 1:</strong> Paraphrase đề b&agrave;i</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-F4y2dfUHno6q3NxqxjnlJ6D8gGg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>C&acirc;u 2:</strong> Thesis statement - Trả lời c&acirc;u hỏi</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E4q7dBPbDo7JCxx6EPMlZvmzgNg\"><em>(*) Bạn học<a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/intro-to-what-extent\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"> <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong>c&aacute;ch viết Introduction cho dạng To what</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong> extent </strong></span></a>ở đ&acirc;y nh&eacute;.</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C8b9d5fR3oWBlUxvumjlfH7lgvh\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TzLtdOsIXoguayxb4TAlra9MgHb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>legal enforcement <em>(thực thi ph&aacute;p luật)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KEDqdCXp3oQ21hxNEmDlbeoUg0O\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>household waste recycling <em>(t&aacute;i chế r&aacute;c thải sinh hoạt)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B5eTdsLoXoK1LxxEfBvlrIWOglc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>government regulations <em>(c&aacute;c quy định của ch&iacute;nh phủ)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TY6sdryvsosrJdxHoaGlAvEgg2N\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>alternative approaches<em> (c&aacute;c phương ph&aacute;p thay thế)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; lập luận &amp; ph&acirc;n BODY:</strong></span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pklmddy9Bo7tzyxz8N8lq70Dgyb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FpNbd7IdBoA4Ctx6gxsl4JN5gie\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OWsUdfdiSo5zJSxHBAElqPqPgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnoWda9NLoogFOxHQgvljDWwgQI\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y0VTdv3RjoVBMUxyY6glDwkugHc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xxw3dzwzloLfvMx31Ozl4U5Rgdd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GNJ6d5ipHoc8XKxmUm7lK2WGgfe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IbjJdoy4ooQvOuxYcF4lOk6kgMf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TrXedfmpHoDN5oxYJwclLFK5g8d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BoHodFLzgoIfzyxCaZAlShJjgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BoHodFLzgoIfzyxCaZAlShJjgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TuMjdHNO7o6RDZxhCF7lLQ1wg0d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OoccdIEpkotmpkxgW24lm9iPgfc\">Bạn n&ecirc;n n&oacute;i r&otilde; quan điểm của m&igrave;nh l&agrave; đồng &yacute;, hoặc kh&ocirc;ng đồng &yacute; với quan điểm của đề. Ở đ&acirc;y, theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>&nbsp;với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong>, YouPass sẽ chọn quan điểm '<strong>kh&ocirc;ng</strong> <strong>đồng &yacute;'</strong>, v&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh tin rằng <strong>'so với c&aacute;c y&ecirc;u cầu ph&aacute;p l&yacute;, c&aacute;c giải ph&aacute;p phi ph&aacute;p l&yacute; hiệu quả hơn nhiều trong việc th&uacute;c đẩy c&aacute;c th&oacute;i quen t&aacute;i chế bền vững'.</strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CDhid62zsoHJICxwZtClCTFFgUV\"><em>(*) Bạn t&igrave;m hiểu về bản chất của <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong> ở b&agrave;i học thử n&agrave;y nh&eacute;:<a href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cach-lap-luan-4060\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\"> <span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><strong>Logic lập luận dạng 'To What Extent'</strong></span></a></em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PJYPd3ITZopTTZx3Ldclc9tAgGh\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với <strong>c&aacute;ch lập luận 40/60</strong> th&igrave; ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ sắp xếp &yacute; tưởng v&agrave;o 2 BODY như sau:</div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EP7Edli6voXvOJxSGIUlcNrDgZc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 1:</strong> M&igrave;nh sẽ b&agrave;n về một số lợi &iacute;ch nhỏ của việc ch&iacute;nh phủ ban h&agrave;nh luật bắt buộc t&aacute;i chế.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YVBidJtxnoHuXex8PiLlW142gPb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>BODY 2:</strong> Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng việc thực hiện c&aacute;c giải ph&aacute;p phi ph&aacute;p l&yacute; mang lại những lợi &iacute;ch đ&aacute;ng kể hơn.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WGTfdw4O3on9AjxhagAlXTeWgDe\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G92Kd4ANqoNYRGxpRJelWN1YgJf\"><em>(*) Nếu bạn chưa nắm vững về cấu tr&uacute;c đoạn văn v&agrave; logic ph&aacute;t triển &yacute; theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong>th&igrave; bạn h&atilde;y xem c&aacute;c b&agrave;i học sau trước khi viết b&agrave;i theo gợi &yacute; ở bước 3 nh&eacute;:</em></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DnkqdOxQboGxb4xEDoglSjj3gmf\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/cau-truc-doan-van\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic sắp xếp th&ocirc;ng tin trong paragraph</a></span></strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MJRmdCR5NoHncAxPBY7lElQHgl7\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-reason-impact\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Reason v&agrave; Impact</a></span></strong></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-B2mddVfFPoMBzBx28NDltQr4gqu\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219);\"><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/development-example\" data-lark-is-custom=\"true\">Logic ph&aacute;t triển core idea bằng Example</a></span></strong></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h2 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 1: </strong>B&agrave;n về một số lợi &iacute;ch nhỏ của việc một số lợi &iacute;ch nhỏ của việc ch&iacute;nh phủ ban h&agrave;nh luật bắt buộc t&aacute;i chế.</span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Kk5gd8w6foneJkxtmd7ld1C4grP\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OTuvdKP8xofWPhxe3dnljyPXgvd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GGx2dtMsVo2SRMxTaHOlDGY0gIh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OUsndgv96oXwDFxW1FrloHVrgAe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GRTBdEWugofGoixOPJblvMOygNU\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CqPEd28cco0ycmxZHuQlljkHgMe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-T4nldWXyRoUmvgxl7nOldzdAgIf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CizadgB9moHAc1xIKRIlK0EVgAz\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TYRIdhFgWoNmKuxEEpklKyzbgMh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FZHPdYYU5oHSRix4IyWlo1lTgSO\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WFlOdn0L6o9tGSxuugml62PSg9d\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A6ABdum2roKdXNxQrTWlclq5gKd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SLtCd8WGXo2M6TxHo1Ll9lFBgbg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JPp1dSDkkoE0p3x6zHulYISNgYd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Topic sentence: </strong></span>Phải thừa nhận rằng, <em>luật bắt buộc t&aacute;i chế (mandatory recycling laws)</em> c&oacute; thể mang lại một số lợi thế trong việc khuyến kh&iacute;ch mọi người t&aacute;i chế nhiều r&aacute;c thải hơn.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R80bdHWFioZ24axEYQxlwu1fgce\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KOljd41OUoHpPwxz6Nel6soXgcc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1</strong>: Một lợi &iacute;ch l&agrave; <em>c&aacute;c y&ecirc;u cầu ph&aacute;p l&yacute; (legal requirements)</em> tạo ra <em>cơ chế thực thi r&otilde; r&agrave;ng (clear enforcement mechanisms)</em> với <em>c&aacute;c h&igrave;nh phạt (penalties)</em> cụ thể.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ju2Mdd14GodhZQxyRsql4Gwugfd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact: </strong>Do đ&oacute;, mọi người sẽ sợ bị <em>phạt tiền (fines)</em> hoặc c&aacute;c hậu quả kh&aacute;c v&agrave; <em>tu&acirc;n thủ (comply)</em> ngay cả khi họ <em>ban đầu</em> <em>miễn cưỡng (initially reluctant to do sth)</em> tham gia v&agrave;o <em>bảo vệ m&ocirc;i trường (environmental protection)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FQgfdOoVtoXz1SxzCdulgTsKg5c\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZKOydlLL5oqctKxldr5lGix2gZg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Ngo&agrave;i ra, <em>thực h&agrave;nh t&aacute;i chế được ti&ecirc;u chuẩn h&oacute;a (standardized recycling practices)</em> th&ocirc;ng qua luật ph&aacute;p đảm bảo c&aacute;c <em>quy tắc nhất qu&aacute;n (consistent rules) </em>tr&ecirc;n c&aacute;c khu vực kh&aacute;c nhau.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RK17dq5zmoMkL0xl18Dl4qlTgBg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact:</strong> Kết quả l&agrave;, điều n&agrave;y <em>loại bỏ sự nhầm lẫn về (eliminate confusion about sth)</em> việc t&aacute;i chế những vật liệu g&igrave; v&agrave; c&aacute;ch <em>ph&acirc;n loại (sort)</em> ch&uacute;ng đ&uacute;ng c&aacute;ch, từ đ&oacute; tạo ra một <em>hệ thống thống nhất (uniform system)</em> m&agrave; mọi người đều c&oacute; thể tu&acirc;n theo bất kể họ ở đ&acirc;u.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Viết BODY 2: </strong>Tr&igrave;nh b&agrave;y quan điểm c&aacute; nh&acirc;n rằng việc thực hiện c&aacute;c giải ph&aacute;p phi ph&aacute;p l&yacute; mang lại những lợi &iacute;ch đ&aacute;ng kể hơn.</span></h3>\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KrtVdtupRoKL6sxjDB2lsqewgkf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IpmcdM2KVo20yvx1AcclbEoFgNe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WdeNdWsDkoHkxfxFq99lekOpgte\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zq8Ed5ZPxoJixmxjWwPlsAd9gQ8\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Q9QVdRGxLozW5JxLNrOlZt4TgTh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ec7GdL8hOopk25xWQG2llrpWgfd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S88bdXvGSorowHxwaxulSLSbgsh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-An7YdeKksognslxRwyBlLIxig1c\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MTcmdZobEoTmv6x3FLVlPSQfgzd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IQk7dtFfcodO74x8BqAlUFO8gug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Pz3Xdb2aLo9ZTbxB301lvayRgjh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JcjZd1zD3odNAnxHVYYl7RJ6gTb\"><strong><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">Topic sentence:</span> </strong>Tuy nhi&ecirc;n, t&ocirc;i tin rằng <em>c&aacute;c giải ph&aacute;p phi ph&aacute;p l&yacute; (non-legal solutions)</em> hiệu quả hơn nhiều trong việc th&uacute;c đẩy c&aacute;c th&oacute;i quen t&aacute;i chế bền vững.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-R64edpq5poRCWjxnnN6lEYVzgIg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 1:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NJVJdxfXvo1z9RxINQ4lBLdygke\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 1: </strong>Một lợi thế l&agrave; <em>c&aacute;c chiến dịch gi&aacute;o dục v&agrave; n&acirc;ng cao nhận thức (education and awareness campaigns)</em> c&oacute; thể dạy mọi người về lợi &iacute;ch m&ocirc;i trường của việc t&aacute;i chế v&agrave; tầm quan trọng của <em>giảm thiểu chất thải (waste reduction)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QAr9d7RNhoiY43x4kMplMhG1gAf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Impact: </strong>Điều n&agrave;y gi&uacute;p họ hiểu được tầm quan trọng một c&aacute;ch tự nguyện thay v&igrave; th&ocirc;ng qua cưỡng bức, điều n&agrave;y tạo ra <em>sự thay đổi h&agrave;nh vi l&acirc;u d&agrave;i thực sự (genuine long-term behavioral change)</em> thay v&igrave; chỉ l&agrave; tu&acirc;n thủ c&aacute;c quy tắc.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-K9XSdNjroouiLyxPv3plCUydgqa\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Supporting idea 2:</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HPggdsMHkoCNkUxpUDWlZJ3ugng\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Core idea 2:</strong> Hơn nữa, <em>hệ thống khuyến kh&iacute;ch v&agrave; khen thưởng kinh tế (economic incentives and reward systems) </em>c&oacute; thể th&uacute;c đẩy mọi người th&ocirc;ng qua c&aacute;c lợi &iacute;ch c&aacute; nh&acirc;n như tiền, giảm gi&aacute; hoặc <em>giảm thuế (tax reductions)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-THYFdO42EogaowxfBLDlOXL6gaf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Reason:</strong> Đ&oacute; l&agrave; bởi v&igrave; điều n&agrave;y cung cấp động lực bền vững hơn so với nỗi sợ h&igrave;nh phạt m&agrave; c&aacute;c y&ecirc;u cầu ph&aacute;p l&yacute; thường dựa v&agrave;o, khuyến kh&iacute;ch <em>sự tham gia tự nguyện (voluntary participation)</em> v&agrave;o c&aacute;c chương tr&igrave;nh t&aacute;i chế.</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Viết Conclusion:</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QkOnd9VeToRuWPxTqkUlIuw9gif\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MGPwd7mnhojSSExL2sIl4MDVgae\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jx3IdxsyToocMyxrcHBlR5M4gTb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"Dt2fdKQh8oQDZXxORVzlyE5bgdj\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Z215dilK9oetfOxPDFol02JKgkg\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JRbGdLxfwoyo3LxfaWvlKYZxgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-S41gdx1Yho0RQhxH1Zclco4KgPH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MDkodyWDGo2nbTx3llNlDkiTgye\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bx6adWi8AoLDF0xo9FAl8FSSgig\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Y8TJdaqR0oT0n0xPP4JlvEIWg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wx2adUP2GoZ4bwxAGtSlFbGzg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HhjYd198Qo0hYvxQQmNlpg7jg9b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VcX1d428yonLO6x57fRl4Gg7gdb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Bạn h&atilde;y viết Conclusion bằng c&aacute;ch <strong>t&oacute;m tắt c&aacute;c luận điểm ch&iacute;nh v&agrave; khẳng định lại quan điểm</strong> của m&igrave;nh nh&eacute;!</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-COZtdWSv5oSRruxTvo7lZHgygzb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RFkJdj7WionQjTxBerelAz4FgMb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>government legislation <em>(luật ph&aacute;p của ch&iacute;nh phủ)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Afc4dCzOooBNP1xaOk7lePJagV3\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>recycling rates <em>(tỷ lệ t&aacute;i chế)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BMNVdvm1YoHWIDxaThQlk536g1e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>educational initiatives <em>(c&aacute;c s&aacute;ng kiến gi&aacute;o dục)</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BAw8dpm1AoU439x9sA0lZOebgXh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">financial incentives <em>(khuyến kh&iacute;ch t&agrave;i ch&iacute;nh)</em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 1504,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BExfdexNno5NnFxZmaBlirHSgpf\">Opinions are divided on whether legal enforcement is the most effective method to increase household waste recycling. Although government regulations can provide certain benefits in promoting recycling practices, I believe that alternative approaches such as education and economic incentives are more significant in achieving long-term success.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17942,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1505,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VBgsd8bPCo6CSgx60yTlM6mWgVg\"><strong>Admittedly, mandatory recycling laws can offer some advantages in encouraging people to recycle more waste.</strong> <span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">One benefit is that legal requirements create clear enforcement mechanisms with specific penalties. As a result, people will fear fines or other consequences and comply even if they are initially reluctant to participate in environmental protection.</span> <span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Additionally, standardized recycling practices through legislation ensure consistent rules across different regions. Consequently, this eliminates confusion about what materials to recycle and how to sort them properly, thus creating a uniform system that everyone can follow regardless of their location.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17942,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1506,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A2yod8NQ1odpT5xWwfZltYV8gog\"><strong>However, I believe that non-legal solutions are far more effective in promoting sustainable recycling habits. </strong><span style=\"color: rgb(22, 145, 121);\">One advantage is that education and awareness campaigns can teach people about the environmental benefits of recycling and the importance of waste reduction. This helps them understand the importance voluntarily rather than through force, which creates genuine long-term behavioral change instead of mere compliance with rules. </span><span style=\"color: rgb(35, 111, 161);\">Furthermore, economic incentives and reward systems can motivate people through personal benefits such as money, discounts, or tax reductions. This is beacause this provides more sustainable motivation than the fear of punishment that legal requirements typically rely on, encouraging voluntary participation in recycling programs.</span></div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17942,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 1507,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Conclusion",
            "value": "<div data-page-id=\"JuQideLPRoMGEExA9v7lN5ifg4d\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AYYcdTBwHow8UuxSbM2l8ayZgcb\">In conclusion, while government legislation may have some merit in increasing recycling rates, I believe that educational initiatives and financial incentives are more significant in creating lasting change in people's recycling behavior.</div>\n</div>",
            "question_id": 17942,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
        "time_limit": 30
      }
